---
import bayphl1 from "../../assets/1/banner.svg";
import Block from "./Block.astro";
---

<Block id="preview">
  <p>
    Our first ever event, <a href="/1/">BayPHL 1</a>, took the recent <a
      href="https://24.baphl.org"
      target="_blank"
      rel="noopener noreferrer">BAPHL 24</a
    > and adapted and re-imagined it for the Bay Area.
  </p>

  <p>It ran on November 8th and 9th, 2025!</p>

  <p>
    <a href="/1/">
      <img id="banner" src={bayphl1.src} alt="BayPHL 1" />
    </a>
  </p>

  <p>
    See the <a href="/1/">BayPHL 1 event page</a> for more details and solutions
    or sign up for
    <a
      href="https://groups.google.com/g/bayphl-announce"
      target="_blank"
      rel="noopener noreferrer">our mailing list</a
    > to learn about future events!
  </p>
</Block>
<link
  href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:ital,opsz,wght@0,14..32,100..900;1,14..32,100..900&family=Roboto+Slab:wght@100..900&family=Roboto+Mono:ital,wght@0,100..700;1,100..700&display=swap"
  rel="stylesheet"
/>
